WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.210
Before anything else in this path, one question: what actually is a SOC?

2
00:00:05.210 --> 00:00:12.240
It stands for Security Operations Center, and the name hides how simple the core idea really is.

3
00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:19.510
A SOC is really just three things working together: people, processes, and technology.

4
00:00:19.510 --> 00:00:25.700
Picture a bank's security desk: a wall of camera monitors, watched around the clock by a guard.

5
00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:34.290
A SOC is exactly that, except instead of hallways and doors, it watches your computers, servers, cloud, and accounts.

6
00:00:34.290 --> 00:00:39.790
An alert on an analyst's screen is just the digital version of a motion sensor tripping.

7
00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:45.590
It watches your endpoints — every laptop and server, through EDR agents.

8
00:00:45.590 --> 00:00:48.880
The network — the traffic flowing between systems.

9
00:00:48.880 --> 00:00:54.760
Identity — every login, every privilege change, every failed authentication.

10
00:00:54.760 --> 00:00:58.720
The cloud — your SaaS apps and cloud infrastructure.

11
00:00:58.720 --> 00:01:03.690
And your applications — the web apps and databases the business runs on.

12
00:01:04.190 --> 00:01:08.410
And it never stops, because attackers don't keep business hours.

13
00:01:08.410 --> 00:01:16.640
A SOC that only watches nine-to-five leaves nights and weekends wide open — exactly when many intrusions happen.

14
00:01:16.640 --> 00:01:20.260
So the real ones run around the clock, every day of the year.

15
00:01:20.760 --> 00:01:26.180
One last thing people mix up on day one: a SOC is not the IT helpdesk.

16
00:01:26.180 --> 00:01:31.480
The helpdesk keeps systems working — passwords, printers, slow laptops.

17
00:01:31.480 --> 00:01:37.480
The SOC keeps them safe, asking a different question: is anyone in here who shouldn't be?

18
00:01:37.980 --> 00:01:45.040
So that's a SOC: people, processes, and technology, watching everything, all the time.

19
00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:48.280
Everything else in this path builds on that one idea.
